WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.975
Before building campaign production, define the problem and the decision it will support.

2
00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:10.115
Make the expected outcome measurable, and record what is still an assumption.

3
00:00:10.515 --> 00:00:14.723
Use Notion for the production brief and Miro for the sequence of decisions.

4
00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:20.053
Separate creative exploration from approved scope, then assign a named owner to every handoff.

5
00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.079
Track dependencies and review gates in Jira.

6
00:00:23.079 --> 00:00:27.674
Use Claude to challenge the plan, then compare effort and capacity in Excel.

7
00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:31.314
A change request must show its effect on timing and quality.

8
00:00:31.714 --> 00:00:35.337
Bring the evidence, cost, and next decision into production plan.

9
00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:39.517
The output is a shared direction, with clear ownership and a review point.
